"A new option allows to set the access restricted status via a simple radio "
"in resource form instead of a property."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:168
msgid ""
"Warning: to use only the button is the default behavior. To keep the old "
"behavior via the property, you must set the param level_via_property to true "
"in the file config/local.config.php."
msgstr ""

