"A new option allows to set the access restricted status via a a property "
"with three status (free, reserved, forbidden)."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:185
msgid ""
"Warning: if you use the old mode \"property\", you must update your "
"local.config.php with status \"reserved\"."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:190
msgid ""
"Warning: if you want to hide records and not only media files, the current "
"version may have break some configs. Keep old releases (until 3.3.0.10) in "
"that case for now."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:406
