#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:442
msgid ""
"The structure of the module has been rewritten to make status easier to "
"manage and quicker to check."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:446
msgid ""
"The access status is now independant of the visibility status (public/"
"private)."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:450
msgid ""
"A new checkbox in resource form and a new api argument have been added to "
"allow to recursively set a status."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:454
msgid ""
"The config has been simplified and fully manageable in admin board. The "
"modes \"guest\", \"ip\" and \"user\" are no more exclusive."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:459
msgid ""
"The property mode \"presence\" of a value has been removed for now. The "
"value \"free\", \"reserved\", \"protected\" or \"forbidden\" (or the "
"specified ones) should be set."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:465
msgid ""
"The property mode has been unset during upgrade. Update config, save it, "
"then submit the job in config form."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:471
msgid ""
"The embargo can be set via a specific setting in resource advanced tab or "
"via a property as before. The option should be set in config."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:475
msgid ""
"The properties for embargo has not been updated during upgrade. Update "
"config, save it, then submit the job in config form."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:480
msgid ""
"Warning: you may have to check the config and the resources statuses with "
"the new config. If wrong, save config, then run the job."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:485
msgid ""
"The reserved resources were private, but visible with restricted files: they "
"are now public with reserved files. The private item sets are now free, "
"because their level applies to their items."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade_from_accessresource.php:538
#, php-format
msgid "The module \"%1$s\" was upgraded by module \"%2$s\" and uninstalled."
msgstr ""
"Ar modul \"%1$s\" a zo bet hizivaet gant ar modul \"%2$s\" ha distalet."

#: data/scripts/upgrade_vocabulary.php:36
msgid "The vocabulary \"{vocabulary}\" was updated successfully."
msgstr "Hizivaet eo bet ar geriaoueg \"{vocabulary}\" gant berzh."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:176
msgid "It is now possible to add a page block to request an access."
msgstr "Bremañ e c'haller ouzhpennañ ur bloc'had pajenn evit goulenn un digor."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:181
msgid ""
"New messages were added to make a distinction between user/visitor and "
"accepted/rejected. Check main settings to adapt them."
msgstr ""
"Ouzhpennet ez eus bet kemennadoù nevez evit ober an diforc'h etre implijer/"
"gweladenner hag asantet/dibaset. Gwiriit an arventennoù pennañ evit o "
"azasaat."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:196
msgid ""
"The module manages now http requests \"Content Range\" that allow to read "
"files faster."
msgstr ""
"Ar modul a ver bremañ ar goulennoù HTTP \"Content Range\" a ro an tu da lenn "
"restroù buanoc'h."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:218
msgid ""
"A new access mode allows to limit access to medias to users with a specific "
"email via regex."
msgstr ""
"Ur mod moned nevez a ro an tu da vevenniñ ar moned d'ar mediaoù d'an "
"implijerien gant ur postel resis dre regex."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:293
msgid ""
"The settings \"heading\" was removed from block Access request. New blocks "
"\"Heading\" or \"Html\" were prepended to all blocks that had a filled "
"heading. You may check pages for styles: {json}"
msgstr ""
"Lakaet eo bet an arventenn \"heading\" da get diouzh ar bloc'had \"Access "
"request\". Bloc'hadoù nevez \"Heading\" pe \"Html\" a zo bet lakaet dirak an "
"holl bloc'hadoù a oa ganto un \"heading\" leuniet. Gallout a rit gwiriañ ar "
"pajennoù evit ar stiloù : {json}"

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:303
msgid ""
"The setting \"template\" was moved to the new block layout settings "
"available since Omeka S v4.1. You may check pages for styles: {json}"
msgstr ""
"An arventenn \"stumm\" a zo bet dilec'hiet d'an arventennoù nevez evit "
"aozadur ar bloc'hoù, a c'haller implijout abaoe Omeka S v4.1. Gallout a rit "
"gwiriañ ar pajennoù evit ar stiloù : {json}"

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:310
msgid ""
"The template files for the block Access request should be moved from \"view/"
"common/block-layout\" to \"view/common/block-template\" in your themes. You "
"may check your themes for pages: {json}"
msgstr ""
"Rankout a rafe bezañ dilec'hiet ar restroù patrom evit ar bloc'h \"Goulenn "
"moned\" eus \"view/common/block-layout\" da \"view/common/block-template\" "
"en ho temoù. Gallout a rit gwiriañ ho temoù evit ar pajennoù: {json}"

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:322
msgid "It is now possible to define accesses by sso idps and item sets."
msgstr ""
"Bremañ eo posupl termeniñ an tremenioù dre IDP-où SSO ha strolladoù elfennoù."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:327
msgid ""
"It is now possible to define excluded item sets for accesses by ip and sso "
"idp."
msgstr ""
"Bremañ e c'haller termeniñ strolladoù elfennoù berzet evit an digoroù dre IP "
"hag an IDP SSO."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:334
msgid ""
"When no time is set to an date of end of embargo, the check is now done "
"against 23:59:59 and no more 00:00:00."
msgstr ""
"Pa ne vez ket lakaet eur ebet evit deiziad fin an embargo, e vez graet ar "
"gwiriadenn bremañ da 23:59:59 ha n'eo ket ken da 00:00:00."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:361
msgid ""
"A new option allows to update the status level and to remove the embargo "
"metadata when it ends. Default option is to keep them."
msgstr ""
"Un dibab nevez a ro an tu da hizivaat live ar statud ha da dennañ ar "
"metaroadennoù embargo pa echu. An dibab dre ziouer eo o mirout."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:366
msgid "A job is run once a day to update accesses when embargo ends."
msgstr ""
"Ur wech an deiz e vez lañset ul labour evit hizivaat an tremenoù pa echu an "
"embargo."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:398
msgid ""
"The three criteria to access a media are now fully independant: visibility "
"of item and media should be public; access level should be free (or reserved "
"for authorized users); resource should not be under embargo."
msgstr ""
"An tri ziviz evit kaout moned d'ur media a zo bremañ penn-da-benn dizalc'h : "
"gwelusted an elfenn hag ar media a rank bezañ foran ; al live moned a rank "
"bezañ digoust (pe miret evit an implijerien aotreet) ; ar resurs ne rank ket "
"bezañ dindan embargo."

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:434 Module.php:2438
msgid ""
"The .htaccess rule is managed by the module and protects file types: {types}."
msgstr ""
"Meret e vez ar reolenn .htaccess gant ar modul ha gwareziñ a ra ar seurtadoù "
